<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70;">3.</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> [ ] Determinar alcance (¿cuántos sistemas?)</span></span>
